<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

<table>
  <tr><th>It looks like</th><th>Probably</th><th>Try</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Flat loaf</td><td>Over-proofed</td><td>Shorter rest, colder fridge</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Dense crumb</td><td>Weak starter</td><td>Feed it twice before baking</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Pale crust</td><td>Oven too cool</td><td>Bake hotter, lid on for 20 min</td></tr>
</table>
